<title>UK: SNOOKER-IRISHMAN DOHERTY WINS WORLD TITLE.</title>
<headline>SNOOKER-IRISHMAN DOHERTY WINS WORLD TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>SHEFFIELD 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ken Doherty of Ireland beat Stephen Hendry of Scotland 18-12 in the final to win the World Professional snooker championship on Monday.</p>
</text>
